=\"t-li\">1)</span> Minimum offset between two objects to avoid false sharing. Guaranteed to be at least <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">alignof<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/max_align_t\"><span class=\"kw111\">std::<span class=\"me2\">max_align_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> keep_apart\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    alignas<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">hardware_destructive_interference_size</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic\"><span class=\"kw2083\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atomic</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> cat<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    alignas<span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">hardware_destructive_interference_size</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic\"><span class=\"kw2083\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atomic</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> dog<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Maximum size of contiguous memory to promote true sharing. Guaranteed to be at least <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">alignof<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/max_align_t\"><span class=\"kw111\">std::<span class=\"me2\">max_align_t</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> together\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/atomic/atomic\"><span class=\"kw2083\">std::<span class=\"me2\">atomic</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span c